{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30248","headline":"醉中看花因思去岁之任 · 薛逢","name":"醉中看花因思去岁之任","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"去岁乘轺出上京，军机旦暮促前程。\n狂花野草途中恨，春月秋风劒外情。\n愁见瘴烟遮路色，厌闻溪水下滩声。\n不辞醉伴诸年少，羞对红妆白发生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛逢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30248.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30248","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}